    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55a3cc8c1607c1ee",
      "translationZh": "添加 AGENTS.md 支持：在没有 CLAUDE.md 的项目中，Claude Code 会改为读取 AGENTS.md；可在 /config 的 \"Project instructions\" 中进行修改（尚未在 Bedrock、Vertex 或 Foundry 上提供）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "547b521795ec39b7",
      "translationZh": "为仅通过前向代理进行出站的 Claude 应用网关添加了 CLAUDE_GATEWAY_PROXY_IS_EGRESS_BOUNDARY=1：每个出站请求会将主机名交给代理，而不是在本地解析",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6839fb02d2f6fd13",
      "translationZh": "为 Claude 应用网关的上游添加了可选的 headers: map，以便向您在提供方前运行的代理发送静态头部",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ee1505ef534d5805",
      "translationZh": "添加了一行提示：当后台任务的更新在完成时，若面板如 /tasks 处于打开状态，则显示更新正在等待",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0cd47fc23faf277",
      "translationZh": "修复了 claude -p 和 Agent SDK 会话在内部错误后可能挂起且无结果的问题；现在它们会报告错误并以退出码 1 退出",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6c8bfae657d11841",
      "translationZh": "修复了在之前的助手回合中存在空白文本块（伴随其他内容）时，导致每次请求都因 \"text content blocks must be non-empty\" 而失败的问题，包括在使用 --resume 之后",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "298ef402b2a1ab49",
      "translationZh": "修复了在同一台机器上运行较旧的 Claude Code 构建（例如 IDE 扩展捆绑的 CLI）时，当前版本意外登出的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2b570be5690f0a24",
      "translationZh": "修复了当 ~/.claude.json 中的 customApiKeyResponses 值格式错误时，ANTHROPIC_API_KEY 用户在交互式启动时出现挂起或错误的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c9fbc89728ff5249",
      "translationZh": "修复了更新检查每 30 分钟出错的问题，以及在设置最小或最大版本时，如果代理返回无效版本，claude 更新会挂起的问题；现在会忽略格式错误的 minimumVersion。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f2cdbe9b0edbed78",
      "translationZh": "修复了在 winget 或 apk 管理的安装中，当版本查找失败时，claude 更新错误地报告 \"up to date\" 的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d536a2a9792cbbb1",
      "translationZh": "修复了在重新安装某个会话或其他程序正在使用的插件版本时，claude 插件安装有时会失败并损坏已安装的副本；现在会保持原样的副本不被修改。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce297feef13d6be8",
      "translationZh": "修复了当系统进程、内存或文件句柄耗尽导致搜索无法启动时，Grep 和 Glob 错误地报告无匹配项；现在它们会返回相应的错误信息。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9402b104e423e26e",
      "translationZh": "修复了当目标路径为现有目录时，Write 工具会静默地将回合视为被拒绝的权限而结束；现在它会报告明确的错误。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a9ccda786a794bb",
      "translationZh": "修复了 Edit 工具将转义的反斜杠后跟 uXXXX 文本视为转义字符的问题，这可能导致编辑非 ASCII 字符时错误地重写了转义的反斜杠序列。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f757d18658fbdc02",
      "translationZh": "修复了在包含非 ASCII 文本的非常大的编辑未匹配文件时，Edit 工具错误地报告 \"Invalid regular expression: regular expression too large\"，而应报告 \"String not found in file\"。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "230e7e61104a0408",
